    <span class="badge">Chapter 2 Analysis</span>
    <h1>Initial Feasibility Study</h1>
    <p>A multi-dimensional preliminary evaluation assessing whether proposed system enhancements are technologically, financially, and operationally viable[cite: 1].</p>

    <hr class="section-divider">

    <h2>2.1 Five-Pillar Feasibility Assessment</h2>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li><strong>Technical Feasibility:</strong> Cloud auto-scaling servers, RESTful external payment APIs (PayPal, Wise), and hardware security modules (HSM) are technically attainable with current infrastructure standards[cite: 1].</li>
      <li><strong>Economic Feasibility:</strong> Projected revenues generated from new cross-border fees and reduced dispute-handling labor provide clear, rapid capital recovery[cite: 1].</li>
      <li><strong>Operational Feasibility:</strong> Automated reconciliation engines and revised agent support tools integrate seamlessly into ongoing agent workflows[cite: 1].</li>
      <li><strong>Legal Feasibility:</strong> All proposed transaction architectures, limits, and authentication protocols align fully with Bangladesh Bank regulatory policies and data protection frameworks[cite: 1].</li>
      <li><strong>Schedule Feasibility:</strong> System milestones are phased logically across an estimated 6-month timeline without interrupting daily operations[cite: 1].</li>
    </ul>

    <hr class="section-divider">

    <h2>2.2 Targeted Problem Recommendations</h2>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
      <div style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid var(--border-card); padding: 14px; border-radius: 8px;">
        <strong style="color: var(--primary);">International Gateway:</strong> Partner with Bangladesh Bank to introduce dedicated freelance/remittance gateways with transparent exchange rates[cite: 1].
      </div>
      <div style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid var(--border-card); padding: 14px; border-radius: 8px;">
        <strong style="color: var(--primary);">Infrastructure Scaling:</strong> Deploy distributed auto-scaling servers alongside real-time reconciliation tools to instantly detect unconfirmed debits[cite: 1].
      </div>
      <div style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid var(--border-card); padding: 14px; border-radius: 8px;">
        <strong style="color: var(--primary);">Tiered Fee Schedules:</strong> Introduce volume-based discounts and loyalty fee waivers to reduce the burden on small everyday transactors[cite: 1].
      </div>
      <div style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid var(--border-card); padding: 14px; border-radius: 8px;">
        <strong style="color: var(--primary);">Adaptive Transaction Limits:</strong> Create distinct, verified business tiers and KYC-based limit upgrades rather than static thresholds[cite: 1].
      </div>
    </div>

